{title: Alas! and Did My Savior Bleed}
{key: C}
{time: 4/4}
{meta: tune HUDSON}

{start_of_verse: 1}
A[C]las! and [**]did my [F]Savior [C]bleed
And [C]did my [**]Sovereign [G]die[**]?
Would [C]he de[**]vote that [F]sacred [C]head
For [G]sinners [**]such as [C]I[**]?
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus}
At the [C]cross, at the [F]cross where I [C]first saw the [**]light
And the [C]burden of my [G]heart rolled a[**]way[**]
It was [C]there by [**]faith I re[F]ceived my [C]sight
And [C]now I am [G]happy all the [C]day[**].
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: 2}
Was [C]it for [**]crimes that [F]I have [C]done
He [C]groaned u[**]pon the [G]tree[**]?
A[C]mazing [**]pity! [F]Grace un[C]known!
And [G]love be[**]yond de[C]gree[**]!
